        ),
        explanation="In multi-line scripts, enable 'set -eu' and restrict IFS to safe whitespace to protect against silent unbound variables or unchecked errors.",
        bad_example="#!/bin/sh\ncp -- \"$1\" \"$2\"",
        good_example=(
            "#!/bin/sh\nset -eu\nIFS=\"$(printf '\\n\\t')\"\ncp -- \"$1\" \"$2\""
